OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball player hopes to open
OL,4,Anew venue for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pickleball player, who grew his hobby
OL,7,Finto a club attended by more than 500
OL,8,Fpeople, hopes to develop a venue in
OL,9,FStoke-on-Trent which it says will be
OL,10,Fone of the UK's largest dedicated to
OL,11,Fthe sport.
OL,13,FRob Tayor said the site will be one of
OL,14,Fthe UK's largest dedicated to the
OL,15,Fsport.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
