OL,3,GNEWSAPickleball player hopes to open
OL,4,Anew venue for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director started his Pickleball
OL,7,FPeople company through running play and
OL,8,Fcoaching sessions at leisure centres in
OL,9,FStaffordshire, Shropshire and Cheshire
OL,10,Fand now plans to convert a warehouse
OL,11,Fand offices at Festival Park into a
OL,12,Fnine court site.
OL,14,FPickleball is a mix of tennis,
OL,15,Fbadminton and ping-pong and can be
OL,16,Fplayed by singles or in pairs, indoors
OL,17,For outdoors. Courts are smaller than
OL,18,Ftennis ones and the net is lower.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
